                "text": "Millions across the country are facing higher ACA premiums under the proposed Republican short term funding bill. \n\nRepublicans on the Rules Committee had the chance to stop it today by accepting commonsense amendments \u2014 but they refused. Instead, they chose to play partisan games at the expense of the American people.",
